#api call to user creation
###
POST  http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/register/ 
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"testuser",
    "email":"test12@gmail.com",
    "password":"test@123",
    "phone":9856421307
}

#api call to fetch token
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/token/ 
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"testuser",
    "password":"test@123"

}

#api call to retreieve current user details
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/me/ 
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Token b140e8d3f07f150666144b8848520c67bd3a522f

#api call to get leads data
###
